---

<section class="educational-talks" id="educational-talks">
  <div class="talks-container">

    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Divine Health Homeopathy Education</p>
      <h2>Educational Talks</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Explore free educational presentations designed to introduce the
        principles of classical homeopathy and its practical use for common
        acute concerns.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- UPCOMING TALK -->
    <div class="upcoming-wrap">
      <div class="status-label upcoming-label">Upcoming Talk</div>

      <article class="talk-card upcoming-card">

        <div class="flyer-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/homeopathy-for-colds-2026.jpg"
            alt="Learn How Homeopathy Can Help You This Winter educational talk flyer"
            class="talk-flyer"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="talk-content">
          <p class="talk-type">Free Educational Talk</p>

          <h3>Learn How Homeopathy Can Help You This Winter</h3>

          <p class="talk-topic">
            Acute Treatment of Colds
          </p>

          <p class="talk-description">
          Learn about commonly considered homeopathic remedies for acute
          cold symptoms and how remedy selection is individualized to the
          specific symptoms a person is experiencing.
          </p>

          <div class="event-details">
            <p>
              <strong>Wednesday, November 4, 2026</strong>
            </p>
            <p>7:00 PM Eastern</p>
            <p>Live on Zoom</p>
          </div>

          <div class="talk-actions">
            <a
              href="https://us06web.zoom.us/j/86332707978?pwd=AXFMrxuV0a5isfSbB8aW6u9si8klmZ.1"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="primary-button"
            >
              Join on Zoom
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- PAST TALKS -->
    <div class="past-talks">
      <div class="past-heading">
        <span></span>
        <h3>Past Talks</h3>
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <article class="talk-card past-card">

        <div class="flyer-wrap past-flyer-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/understanding-homeopathy-2026.png"
            alt="Understanding Homeopathy Principles Practice and Philosophy educational presentation flyer"
            class="talk-flyer past-flyer"
          />

          <div class="past-overlay">
            <span>Past Talk</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="talk-content past-content">
          <p class="talk-type">Educational Presentation</p>

          <h3>Understanding Homeopathy</h3>

          <p class="talk-topic">
            Principles, Practice, and Philosophy
          </p>

          <p class="talk-description">
            An introduction to the history, philosophy, foundational
            principles, individualized approach, and practical use of
            classical homeopathy.
          </p>

          <div class="event-details">
            <p>
              <strong>August 19, 2026</strong>
            </p>
            <p>Optimal Wellness Chiropractic</p>
            <p>Bad Axe, Michigan</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .educational-talks {
    background: #fbf7ef;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .talks-container {
    width: min(1120px, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #8b8452;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #173a6a;
  }

  .section-intro {
    margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
    max-width: 660px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #383838;
  }

  .upcoming-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .status-label {
    display: table;
    margin: 0 auto -1rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }

  .upcoming-label {
    background: #173a6a;
    color: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #b8933b;
  }

  .talk-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 0.9fr) minmax(340px, 1.1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
    padding: 3.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 147, 59, 0.45);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: #fffdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(23, 58, 106, 0.08);
  }

  .flyer-wrap {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 470px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .talk-flyer {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .talk-content {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .talk-type {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: #8b8452;
  }

  .talk-content h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #173a6a;
  }

  .talk-topic {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 1.5rem;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #718b62;
  }

  .talk-description {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #383838;
  }

  .event-details {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #b8933b;
  }

  .event-details p {
    margin: 0.3rem 0;
    color: #383838;
  }

  .talk-actions {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #173a6a;
    border: 1px solid #173a6a;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease,
      color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .primary-button:hover {
    background: transparent;
    color: #173a6a;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .past-talks {
    margin-top: 6rem;
  }

  .past-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .past-heading span {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(184, 147, 59, 0.55);
  }

  .past-heading h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #173a6a;
  }

  .past-card {
    background: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.75);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .past-flyer {
    opacity: 0.78;
    filter: saturate(0.9);
    transition:
      opacity 0.25s ease,
      filter 0.25s ease;
  }

  .past-flyer-wrap:hover .past-flyer {
    opacity: 0.95;
    filter: saturate(1);
  }

  .past-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .past-overlay span {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(23, 58, 106, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid #b8933b;
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }

  .past-content {
    opacity: 0.82;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .educational-talks {
      padding: 4.5rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .talk-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .talk-content {
      max-width: none;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .event-details {
      display: inline-block;
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .educational-talks {
      padding: 3.75rem 1rem;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .talk-card {
      padding: 1.35rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .talk-content h3 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .past-heading {
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .past-heading h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  }
</style>